            <!-- HowTo Section -->
            <section id="section-howto" class="content-section">
                <div class="section-header">
                    <h2>How To Use NomadBuild</h2>
                    <p>Learn how to build and flash firmware for your Bitaxe</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="howto-content">
                    <div class="howto-section">
                        <h3>What is NomadBuild?</h3>
                        <p>NomadBuild is a self-sovereign firmware builder for Bitaxe devices. It allows you to build and flash firmware without relying on external services or trusting third parties.</p>
                        
                        <h3>Why use NomadBuild?</h3>
                        <p>By building firmware locally, you can:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Verify the source code before building</li>
                            <li>Customize the firmware to your needs</li>
                            <li>Avoid trusting pre-built binaries from unknown sources</li>
                            <li>Ensure your device is running exactly what you intend</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="howto-section">
                        <h3>Building Firmware</h3>
                        <ol>
                            <li>Open the <strong>Build</strong> tab.</li>
                            <li>Either press <em>Start&nbsp;Build</em> (latest stable) <br>or pick a tag from the list first.</li>
                            <li>Grab a coffee – progress appears in real-time.</li>
                            <li>When you see <strong>Build&nbsp;Successful</strong>, hit the "Flash&nbsp;Device" button to jump straight to flashing.</li>
                        </ol>
                        
                        <h3>Flashing Firmware</h3>
                        <ol>
                            <li>Open the <strong>Flash</strong> tab (or arrive there via the button).</li>
                            <li>Type your Bitaxe's IP (e.g. <code>192.168.1.42</code>).</li>
                            <li>Click <em>Flash&nbsp;Device</em>. The miner will reboot automatically when done.</li>
                            <li>Refresh your Bitaxe web UI to verify the new version appears.</li>
                        </ol>
                        
                        <h3>Troubleshooting</h3>
                        <p>Common issues and solutions:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Build fails:</strong> Run <code>./nomadbuild.sh --build-image</code> to refresh the tool-chain, then try again.</li>
                            <li><strong>Flash fails:</strong> Ensure your Bitaxe and computer are on the same network and the IP is correct.</li>
                            <li><strong>Web UI missing:</strong> Clear your browser cache or open in a private window.</li>
                        </ul>
                        
                        <h3>Getting Help</h3>
                        <p>For further assistance, visit the GitHub repository linked in the About section to report issues or ask questions.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
            
